<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One Corp said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One Corp said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter cut its rating on Banc One Corp to accumulate from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 1/8 at 38.</p>
</text>
